	<div class="textblock    bg-white  text-center  text-mo-center container-width-medium" id="intro">
		
		
    	
    	
    	
    	<div class="textblock__body padding-top--48 padding-bottom--48">
				
				
			<h2 class="textblock__title" data-font-size-pc="48" data-font-size-mo="30">Can your phone do that?</h2>
			
			
			
			<p class="textblock__desc" data-font-size-pc="18" data-font-size-mo="14">Already here and running, Galaxy AI offers a wide variety of features that you can jump right into. Get your Galaxy device and try out new ways to create and communicate, to plan and understand, to get things done and get ahead.</p>
			
			
			
		</div>
