									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Make your picture perfect in seconds</h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Photo Assist on Galaxy phones and tablets makes editing your photos effortless. Move, resize or delete objects by hand and have AI fill in the gaps for a seamless look. You can also enter a prompt or reference image to add new elements into the image, like putting a hat on a subject. Enjoy the freedom to imagine, the room to be creative and the fun of trying out different looks.<sup>1</sup></p>
									</div>
