										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Creative Studio</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Create the unique designs of your imagination<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Explore your artistic side in the Creative Studio. Create your own personalized designs for greeting cards, wallpapers and more by combining text with drawings or images. Generate sticker sets in the styles and concepts you want, like cute emojis to show your friends. There's just so much to explore, imagine and share.<sup>2</sup></p>
									</div>
