									<div class="image image--dyn-height">
										<img class="image__preview lazy-load-man responsive-img" data-desktop-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/galaxy_ai/02_creative_studio_pc.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" data-mobile-src="//images.samsung.com/is/image/samsung/assets/pk/s2602/galaxy_ai/02_creative_studio_mo.jpg?$LazyLoad_Home_JPG$" alt="A cat wears a birthday party hat. The Generate button is directly underneath. Stickers in 3D emoji style generated with Creative Studio surround the cat. " data-aem-asset-id=""/>
