										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Auto Trim</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Instantly compile your best moments<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Want a handy highlight reel of what you did this weekend? Auto Trim can make one for you instantly, extracting key moments in your videos to create a clip of highlights centered around a specific activity. You'll get beautifully edited videos to share with your friends and family without the work of actual editing.<sup>4</sup></p>
									</div>
