						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Now Nudge</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">A little nudge to your next action makes life easier<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Simplify your mobile experience with a bit of well-timed assistance. Now Nudge recognizes what's happening on your screen and provides relevant suggestions based on the context — like shortcuts to jump to your next action. So when you're messaging about plans with a friend, Now Nudge can pop a shortcut you can tap to jump straight to your Calendar app.<sup>5</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
