						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Now Brief</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Get personalized insights useful to you<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Now Brief sends snapshots of useful info to your Galaxy phone or tablet, specifically tailored for you. Stay on track with timely updates like the morning weather and nightly recaps. Receive briefs and reminders with details you don’t want to miss — like the time and place of a reservation before you need to head out. Enjoy content recommendations that sync with your life, like exercise playlists as you're working out. Now Brief even works with Galaxy Buds, delivering Audio Briefs for easy listening.<sup>6</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__button">
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
									
								</div>
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__disclaimer">
									
