						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Transcript Assist</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Turn long recordings into short summaries<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Transcript Assist converts your recordings into text, then lets you summarize or translate them with a tap. Go back and review complex conversations with ease, or take lecture notes simply by recording your class and tapping Summarize. You can capture the key points efficiently and find what matters faster.<sup>8</sup></p>
									</div>
