						<div class="feature-column-carousel__feature bg-white">
							<div class="feature-column-carousel__content">
								<div class="feature-column-carousel__text-wrap">
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__eyebrow-text">Interpreter</p>
									</div>
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Don't let language be a barrier<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Travel the world more easily with a multilingual buddy in your back pocket. Interpreter can translate speech in real time to your Galaxy Buds for smooth listening in your own language, while simultaneously displaying the translated text on your Galaxy phone — so you can conveniently follow along as the waiter tells you about the menu. Two languages can be displayed on the screen at the same time through a split view, allowing both parties to read along.<sup>9</sup></p>
									</div>
								</div>
