									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Wake up feeling more refreshed with a bit of Bedtime Guidance. Just wear your Galaxy Watch to bed, and it'll find your ideal bedtime based on your personal sleep data. Plus, you can easily customize to your needs from your phone or tablet, like setting a target wake-up time or turning on bedtime notifications.<sup>13</sup></p>
