									<div class="feature-column-carousel__title">
										<h3 class="feature-column-carousel__title-text">Advance your health journey with Energy Score<br /></h3>
									</div>
									
									<div class="feature-column-carousel__text">
										<p class="feature-column-carousel__text-text">Enjoy deeper insights into your daily condition. Galaxy AI powers your device to provide more intelligent insights based on your activity, sleep and other Galaxy Watch data — breaking down your Energy Score at a detailed level and explaining various factors, so you can make health decisions suitable for your life. Your Energy Score is not just a number but a greater dashboard of your health, helping you understand yourself better and take the action you need.<sup>14</sup></p>
